  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HiFi - Harnessing Innovation for Financial Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide access to poor people to a broad range of financial services such as payments, savings, loans, and insurance by continuing to support piloting new ideas and approaches, and to support technical assistance regulators and commercial players for enhancing industry knowledge and practice about business models, pricing and design of financial products. Access to these services enables consumers to acquire productive assets, invest in health and education and make other purchases that enrich their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
